# sha256 pins of the private SPECviewperf 15.0.0 copy (docs/DOWNLOADS.md, "SPECviewperf private copy"). One line per
# object, exactly `<name the box asks the Worker for> sha256=<64 hex>`; scripts/bench/box/specviewperf_stage.sh
# reads the first line and refuses (RETRY class=MEDIA) without it. fetch_bench_data.sh deletes bytes that do not match.
#
# PROPOSED 2026-11-07, OWNER TO CONFIRM (the licensee pins; docs/DOWNLOADS.md "handling rules"): the values are the
# ones in the object's own CHECKSUMS.txt, recorded in traces/specviewperf_vast_20261105/spec/CHECKSUMS_pins.txt and
# matched by a download of the object on two Vast boxes (2026-11-05 and 2026-11-07, traces/specviewperf_native_20261107/
# README.md names the first 8 digits). The second line is the sha256 of the decompressed tar (informational).
